<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\その女、闇より出る的なBGM.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\夜桜3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Through the path buried in cherry blossoms―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\墓地広場山側.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
through the clearing―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
through the forest―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
We went down underground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And on, deeper and deeper―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\空洞.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? The mummy was here, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Did someone carry it off?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Through the narrow cave, we climbed a straight slope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's steep, but something like vines is strung over the ground and the walls, and we can climb holding on by hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Underfoot, too, the vines keep us from slipping, making the climb easier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if someone had worked on it so that we could climb even a little more easily.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa... we're seriously climbing this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll go look first!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> climbed here and reached the top.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> must be terribly <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おび">scared</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait for me, I'm coming.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
10 minutes―
{PAUSE ""}
20 minutes―
{PAUSE ""}
30 minutes―<PG>
Up the steep slope―and up, and up―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Heeey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">aa! You there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm here! I can see light!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This steep climb up the slope, with nothing at all getting in our way.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$0C0C0C" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
This steep climb, too, will soon be over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "$1E1E1E" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It's up ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "$2D2D2D" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
no, the human who became <STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "$BD0C02" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The girl who became <STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment we came out―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A wind strong enough to blow away all the fatigue up to now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A mountain ringed by cherry trees and a moon so bright it hardly seemed like night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\温泉夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The sound of running water, and steam rising thick.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The smell of sulfur.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right nearby, boiling water seems to be welling up from underground.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-100\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血普通.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... I'm sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE> thin voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eyelids so swollen there's no telling how much she cried.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a pale face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"What on earth... what on earth did you do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I raised my voice at <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> to be this frightened... what on earth did they do to her?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What did <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> ever do...!<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Haha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, we meet again after so long, and that's quite a way to talk. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Before that, isn't there something you should say to me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I died trying to get the balloon </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> let go of, you know? Nothing to say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> put a hand on my shoulder.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you don't need to listen to this crap."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Oh, come on, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s cold to me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you understand, don't you? The one who had it hardest when I died was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked at <STYLE ID="2">Obasan</STYLE>: 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬うつむき血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
head down, trembling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then she fixed <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE> with a hard <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
