<BR>
Having set <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> down at some point, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> sneers at <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, the greetings are over, so let's get to the main subject."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You did read what I left about the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s true identity, properly, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> hasn't read it directly, but she seems to have the gist, so that's no problem."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"I'd have liked only </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> to come here, to be honest. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Well, I suppose </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> was needed as bait to lure </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">The rest of you, since you're here, enjoy the show from the audience."</STYLE><PG>
A light comment, like the opening remarks of a show.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may be light to these two, but I can't forgive two people who put <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> through this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it's <STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s influence, I have no intention of warming to these two now.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then you're done with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, aren't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　If it's me you want, give </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what do you say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hm... fine, I suppose. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> can check her deductions against the answers from the audience seats too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE> prodded the crouching <STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE> back with his toe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obeying, <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> walked unsteadily toward us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm sorry...! If I'd been careful, I wouldn't have ended up a hostage...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't worry about it. Wherever you'd run, it'd be the same. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, we were meant to end up here."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you meet your dad again after all this time and feel nothing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　All you've done is </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> at me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn right, you impostor!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says, the real </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never said nasty, needling things like that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Harsh... Then why not ask the </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> over there?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Whether I'm the real thing or an impostor."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"N-</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">that guy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The body alone is real. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But the mind has been completely taken over by </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
