{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, do we need that story right now? You're getting to the main subject, aren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ah, right, right, it slipped my mind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">My brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―impersonating him has gotten into my bones."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Daddy's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hmm, so you really didn't notice! Well, same face, same voice."</STYLE><PG>
