{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So the one who cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> head was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Of course, it was me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Doing that started the rumor of a curse, so that people dying every year is, in a sense, natural. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">We need a lot of corpses soon, you see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">We have to make a lot of cherry trees bloom in this settlement too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"In the old days Droga was made now and then and used for the hunt. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">In exchange, they became cherry trees. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">The Verde mummy―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">this settlement worshipped Verde until 70 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">And so Droga users die in April and become cherry trees."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"That was the most stable cycle for the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Cherry trees are born at regular intervals, and thanks to the legend of the Green-Eye Curse-Killing, third-generation children are killed as soon as they're born. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Women who marry in from outside are given high status and become mothers who aren't Droga users. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That way, the residents are first and second generation only."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Normally third-generation corpses are needed for reproduction, but thanks to the Verde mummy, no new corpses are needed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">The third generation becomes able to produce the spores that control the first and second, but on the other hand its blood carries an enzyme that destroys the Goddess's cells directly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">It was necessary and dangerous at the same time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"So the third generation is sent the order to kill those with precognition―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">that is, those the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s will can reach. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Then everyone thinks it's a cursed child and tries to kill it fast, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　The Green-Eye Curse-Killing is a device for disposing of the third generation that threatens the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is still mid-evolution; making up for a weakness like this takes time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"But something happened that broke that cycle. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">A religious group called the Holy Cerejeira Church came and carried off most of the cherry trees here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Someone had noticed, you see. Someone noticed that the cherry trees here are the kind that take over humans."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The Grand Witch two generations back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">-san. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The one who's said to be the only one who didn't die in April."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\住民簿\桔梗.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"She was a very </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="そうめい">wise</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> woman, I hear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Why people die in April, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">why there is Droga, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">why they worship Verde. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Kikyo noticed the possibility that the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> was taking over humans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">I'll grant that the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is a threat to humans."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Kikyo sealed Verde away and gave falsificaso to the residents. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">And to clear away the cherry trees here, she had the Holy Cerejeira Church take them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Even the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> never imagined the residents themselves would try to be rid of the cherry trees they'd relied on all along."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"About 120 years ago, a man named </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="あきら">Akira</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> Niimura, who later became Kikyo's husband, went to Tokyo City. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">And there, I'm told, he presented Droga to those in power at the time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That was how Kikyo came to be connected with this Arata settlement and married in. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> killed Kikyo's family and tried to sap her will."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, she could have killed Kikyo, but if she became Grand Witch in a listless state, the settlement's people would be easier to control, so keeping her alive was more convenient. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But it was too late. The residents no longer used Droga, and the Holy Cerejeira Church came here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">What's more, they had ties to the Japanese government, and ample funds too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> agonized over it, I hear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Whether to put the dead to work and resist the Holy Cerejeira Church. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> or not, she could hardly stand against a group with the state behind it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">All she could do was watch quietly as the cherry trees were carried off."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Above all, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> feared her true identity becoming public. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">If Droga came into use worldwide, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s body would be used up and could only perish. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Tens of thousands of years spent growing, and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> suffered because of humans' foolish ideas."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> lost many cherry trees, couldn't grow, and had to start over from scratch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">For that, humans were now nothing but a nuisance. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s body is greedily devoured by humans, and compared with them, animals without intelligence are far better suited to the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s reproduction. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">She decided to drive the humans out of the land of Arata."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then the real reason behind the wave of elderly suicides was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\住民簿\自殺.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"It was to acquire the intelligence of modern humans as quickly as possible, and to warn that this is no place for humans to live. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Until now the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> had grown with humans as her main seedbed, but now humans were nothing but a threat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">The </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> thought no human would want to live in a settlement where you kill yourself at 75."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"But the residents here were tougher than expected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Until 10 years ago she kept them in check with the wave of suicides, but it didn't show much effect. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Driving out residents rooted here for hundreds of years isn't so easy, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">So she switched to the curse-killings, which </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="あお">stir up</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> more fear."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So you were killing the old people and making it look like suicide."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, that's about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is a kind one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Until 10 years ago she avoided laying hands on young people with a future as much as she could, and chose the old, who by age were only waiting for death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But now that there's no one over 75 left―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for that...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Don't get the wrong idea. In the end, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> killing herself was </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> own will. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">A chance just happened to come around, that's all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―if she hadn't gone and confessed the Droga business to </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, none of this would have happened."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hahaha, just kidding. Either way, we meant to increase the corpses by every means there was. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">For instance, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事森.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\桃子血を浴びる.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">even a visitor coming from outside―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\春花ナイフ2バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> going into mountain seclusion―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">there are any number of ways. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">As needed, I swapped places with </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> and adjusted the information inside the settlement."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What did you do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I did nothing to </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> did nothing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">I just pretended to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">him</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> once in a while, when I saw the chance. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Thanks to that, it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">he</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> got suspected of being the curse-killer―a little hard on him, I suppose. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> dead, and then treated as the culprit himself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Gh...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s always cared about </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the settlement...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Give </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> back!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Yes, here's Mom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Brutal.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">Hee hee hee, how brave she is, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">my daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"It's been a little while, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s already..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I did try to keep </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> in the settlement, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'re as simple as ever, so it wasn't much trouble."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-what are you talking about...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"You remember what we talked about just now, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　I taught you what a </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> who can do nothing should do to be useful, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You tricked me...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Don't make strange accusations. I didn't tell a single lie. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Oh, but that while </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> body was being repaired, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> wouldn't notice―that was a lie. I'm sorry."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Hahaha, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> isn't that much of a dud. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That's as easy as watching TV while you eat dinner. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That said, she can't keep watch all the time. Even the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> needs regular rest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, that's enough preamble. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Honestly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, you're bad at getting to the point. You were the same before you died."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Back then I was a wimp and just couldn't get it out. Now I've simply become </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="じょうぜつ">talkative</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Yes, yes, enough of that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE> reached a hand toward us.<PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, come here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> come over here to us, and it's all over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What are you saying! Like she'd just go trotting over because you said so!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"'The shinigami are the familiars of the four divine messengers who serve Abaddon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">They appear from a volcano of sulfur. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">What the Grand Witch must do―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">is to keep Abaddon and the four divine messengers sealed away.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">That's the saying handed down to the Grand Witches."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Calling the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> 'Abaddon'―such an awful way to put it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, thanks to that odd phrasing it lost all reality and became a mere legend, which suited us."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"The first-generation dead, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">The second-generation dead, Sakura Niimura. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">The first-generation living, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">One more, a living one of the second generation, and these four 'divine messengers' are </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="そろ">assembled</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The living of each generation and those who died within 20 years―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">with the four of us as the last seedbed, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> gains complete resistance to third-generation blood, and eternal rest comes to her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Deep among cherry trees no one can disturb, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> will spend all </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="えいごう">eternity</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"A few days before </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> died, she had used falsificaso for </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> sake, so she was no longer second generation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The divine messengers should be incomplete."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Nice. A sharp objection. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But did </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> really use the falsificaso on herself?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, you understand by now, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　The second and third generations can be made to perceive visions and voices alike, at the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'s will. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">I only believed I'd injected myself with falsificaso."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">My brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> thought it was dangerous to use falsificaso on </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> while its toxicity was unknown. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> meant to inject the falsificaso without telling anyone, at the risk of her life. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Somewhere no one could see her―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">hiding in that dark, narrow hole."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"In the end, I only went into the hole. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Telling no one means there's no one to prove whether I really used the falsificaso on myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Hee hee hee, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> didn't notice this one, it seems."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> knew their danger sense was useful to everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">So they lived as honestly as they could, so as not to become the boy who cried wolf, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　That honesty backfired, is all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"In the same way, I showed </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> visions of killing the residents."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Th-then why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> murderous intent disappear!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Honestly, for a </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> you're short on imagination. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">These past few years </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> couldn't use her danger sense in the settlement, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> couldn't use hers here at first either, could she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Same principle."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"You mean you deliberately stopped releasing spores...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"That's right. And once I die, the matter of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> is over."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, none of that matters now, does it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Come, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">living one of the second generation, come over here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―spend the endless ages with her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"D-don't be ridiculous! No way, not even if it kills me!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So you did knock </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> out, carry her to the underground cave, and inject falsificaso to cure the third-generation traits. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And then injected Droga right away to make her first generation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Well done, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, how perceptive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">And on the way here, by touching Tomi's mummy, I was reborn as the fourth generation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I feel very good right now, you know?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Well, I could make </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> obey by force, but I don't much care for that sort of thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> really is a kind one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">If she wanted, she could kill you all this instant."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"That wasn't written in the report </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> read either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Make this cherry tree grow huge, and spores come out that kill humans instantly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Spores that kill instantly...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\骸骨.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Everyone here has breathed in spores from the air at some point. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">If altered spores were scattered, anyone not infected with Droga would die in moments. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">And touch the petals, and the body melts away bit by bit and is absorbed as the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s nourishment."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Now, you don't want that, do you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, it all depends on </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> decision. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Become one with us, or everyone dies here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Well? I don't think it's such a hard choice."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Up to me... To save everyone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Don't believe a word these guys say! It's all got to be garbage!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"No, it's all true, actually..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I'd rather not do that if I can help it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">I do dislike violence, and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> wouldn't forgive killing people just to make them obey. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, you brought it, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Of course."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE> pulled something like a large doll out of the deep drifts of cherry petals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For its size, he lifted it with strange ease.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Ojisan's</STYLE> superhuman strength, or was it light to begin with―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "12" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\E3839BE383A9E383BC3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"What is that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Hold your breath!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> suddenly clamped her hands over my nose and mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"That won't do any good. It infects not just through breathing, but through the eyes or even the skin."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Now―Tomi, who became the great sacrifice―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">worship Verde. She is the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'s magnificent slave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is this, what's going on!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is that mummy supposed to be...!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, get away from here, now! If you touch the spores coming off that mummy, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'ll end up like </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's all this about spores and mummies...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Told that out of nowhere, I can't keep up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, I understood that I'd end up like <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're too soft. Lend me the mummy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血アップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> half wrested the mummy from <STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE> and started walking toward us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Close your eyes! Hold your breath!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> covered my whole face, but the shock of it sent me into a panic, and my breathing only grew rougher.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My lungs took in a great deal of air, and that made my heart race all the more.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this... 
{PAUSE ""}
the end...!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, suddenly, I heard the sound of <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> running off into the distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂飛込み.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
And from a little way off, the sound of a splash―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What? What happened...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
