{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Ch-</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">! What are you doing!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Now the spores won't scatter!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two corpses, flustered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where they were looking lay the hot-water stream.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
