<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> pulled out a single <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE> sheet of paper.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
