<STYLE ID="23">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="23">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="24"> were injected with Droga, but I've cured it with falsificaso.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="23">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="24"> pretend you've surrendered to </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, and when you see your chance, get rid of the Verde mummy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">Burn it, or soak it in water.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">I'm counting on you.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">Kotaro</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> hid down in that cave because he expected this would happen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">He said he was going around to thank people for putting out the fire."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, all this time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">To get rid of the mummy, I had no choice but to put on this act. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s weakness―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> walked toward <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
