{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, hold out your arm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
At that, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> slid the knife across <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> arm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ow! What are you doing? </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A thin film of <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> blood clung to the knife.
{PAUSE ""}
