{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... This is </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s weakness. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Get freshly shed third-generation blood on them, and you can damage them like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I see. What </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> said―I finally understand it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">'Only the green-eyed prevail. Those who have become green-eyed wither the bewitching flowers and return the dead to the underworld.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">To overcome that weakness, they need the four divine messengers. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Right now, by getting the blood on it, we can defeat </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!"</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="9"><TXSPS>"Gh... we should kill them with the spores after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Hah, hah... yes... There's nothing else for it."</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
