{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
From every direction of the view before us, cherry trees stretching up to heaven one after another―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their number was <STYLE ID="26" RUBY="あまた">countless</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And not one was of any ordinary size.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dozens of meters tall, the tallest on the scale of hundreds of meters.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What the hell is this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Everyone, hold hands!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We held hands tight so as not to be swallowed by the shaking and the cherry trees shooting up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bright moonlight lost its light more and more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―the moon hadn't dimmed; a giant cherry tree had spread its branches above us and come into bloom.<PG>
