{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> looked up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Following her, we looked around us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\木見上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Perhaps because the giant cherry trees have covered this place, there is no wind to be felt at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the soft rustle of cherry petals piling up can be heard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scent of cherry blossoms, which you never notice normally―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A spring scent I've faintly smelled somewhere before.<PG>
And each and every petal gives off a jewel-like glow, like pink spinel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moonlight shouldn't reach here―is it moonlight reflected over and over from far away?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The faint light that reaches this far dimly lights this place, cut off by the cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A scene as if a painter who loved the moon and flowers had poured his soul into it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this all-too-beautiful world, for a while I forget what is happening now.<PG>
No―is this world really the living world we were in?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did we die in that earthquake just now, and are we in the afterlife?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, that feels more real.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mountains of Arata, sunk to the bottom of a sea of cherry blossoms in an instant after a sudden earthquake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No breath of life can be felt there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Every one of these cherry trees is only a part of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The main body must still be somewhere else. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Most likely, to grow this many cherry trees, it drained all the nourishment from the land across Arata."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
